{"id":"zwilling","lemma":"Zwilling","pos":"noun","rank":2810,"glosses":["twin (male or female; the feminine form Zwillingin is rare)","twin (used as a component in numerous compound words such as Zwillingstürme (“Twin Towers”), with (one or more) or without hyphens depending on the word's length and the taste of the writer)"],"ipa":"/ˈt͡svɪlɪŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1f/De-Zwilling.ogg/De-Zwilling.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Zwillinges","plural":"Zwillinge","feminine":"Zwillingin"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich bin ein Zwilling.","en":"I am a twin.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/392105","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Seid ihr wirklich Zwillinge?","en":"Are you really twins?","words":[{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"really, actually"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe einen Zwilling.","en":"I have a twin.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/116932","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null]},{"text":"Sie ist ein Zwilling.","en":"She is a twin.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/45136","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Sie sind keine Zwillinge.","en":"They aren't twins.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/389132","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null]}]}